de, pinned to carry a balance sheet that omits exactly the quarter's unrecorded trade. Both are constructed to break the corresponding precondition the moment the economy does anything. SMOOTH-1 [COVERED] by DABSSmoothMinEscape, SMOOTH-2 [COVERED] by DABSSmoothReluPhantom, CLEAR-1 [COVERED] by DABSGoodsRationing, INV-1 [COVERED] by DABSInventoryStock, ALLOC-1 [COVERED] by DABSAllocationExhaustive, SFC-1 [COVERED] by DABSSFCBalance, MONEY-1 [COVERED] by DABSMoneyEndogenous, DEF-1 [COVERED] by DABSDefaultLossConservation. Remaining checklist item (PARAM-1) untouched.
